  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n25% of k = 10 less than 1200% of 25\n\nCalculation:\n\n25% of k = 1200% of 25 - 10\n\ndfrac{25}{100} × k = dfrac{1200}{100} × 25 - 10\n\n⇒ dfrac{25}{100} × k = 12 × 25 - 10\n\n⇒ dfrac{25}{100} × k = 300 - 10\n\n⇒ dfrac{25}{100} × k = 290\n\n⇒ dfrac{k}{4} = 290\n\n⇒ k = 290 × 4\n\n⇒ k = 1160\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**\n\n9c:T4e",
